Journey: The customer's key pages meet WCAG 2.2 AA
Id: a11y-customer-pages
Tags: @a11y @nonfunctional
Role: policyholder
Risk: 4
Requirements: A11Y-1

Open /login
  Expect the page contains "Sign in to MyCover"
Check the page for accessibility issues at WCAG 2.2 level AA
Log in
Open /app/home
  Expect the page contains "Your policies"
Check the page for accessibility issues at WCAG 2.2 level AA
Click the "Get a quote" link
  Expect the page contains "Calculate premium"
Check the page for accessibility issues at WCAG 2.2 level AA
Click the "Make a claim" link
  Expect the page contains "Supporting documents"
Check the page for accessibility issues at WCAG 2.2 level AA
Click the "My claims" link
  Expect the page contains "My claims"
Check the page for accessibility issues at WCAG 2.2 level AA
